(3,'metro','Anirban_Kolkata','Line 2 Green','Normal','Underwater metro from Howrah to Esplanade took just 6 mins! Super clean and cool.','2026-11-24 18:08:04'),
(4,'general','Debjit_Garia','EM Bypass','Heavy Jam','Slow moving traffic near Ruby Crossing due to road maintenance work. Avoid if heading to Airport.','2026-11-24 18:08:04'),
(5,'metro','Subrata_Metro','Green Line','Normal','Underwater tunnel crossing was ultra-smooth today!','2026-11-24 18:18:08'),
